{"id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-delta2-preservation.md","title":"历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","display":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-delta2-preservation","aliases":["20-lem-delta2-preservation"],"display":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Lemma 7.6.2","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","[[20-df-injury-elements]]","[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","[[20-df-recursive]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-delta2-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-delta2-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-delta2-preservation — 历史保持策略的 Δ₂ 锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Lemma 7.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,C\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,C\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_\\bullet=(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega},C_\\bullet=(C_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\">\\(A_\\bullet=(A_s)_{s\\in\\omega},C_\\bullet=(C_s)_{s\\in\\omega}\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(p\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(c\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。假设</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall s\\in\\omega\\ [|A_s|&lt;\\omega\\land(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [p(x,s)=\\chi_{A_s}(x)])\\land A_s\\subseteq A_{s+1}\\land C_s=\\{x&lt;s:c(x,s)=1\\}],\\\\\nA=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}A_s,\\qquad\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq2,\\\\\n\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\exists v\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\in\\omega\\ [s\\ge v\\Rightarrow c(x,s)=\\chi_C(x)].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall s\\in\\omega\\ [|A_s|&lt;\\omega\\land(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ [p(x,s)=\\chi_{A_s}(x)])\\land A_s\\subseteq A_{s+1}\\land C_s=\\{x&lt;s:c(x,s)=1\\}],\\\\\nA=\\bigcup_{s\\in\\omega}A_s,\\qquad\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq2,\\\\\n\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ \\exists v\\in\\omega\\ \\forall s\\in\\omega\\ [s\\ge v\\Rightarrow c(x,s)=\\chi_C(x)].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对同一对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_\\bullet,C_\\bullet)\">\\((A_\\bullet,C_\\bullet)\\)</span> 使用上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,m,r_*\">\\(\\ell,m,r_*\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\notin\\mathcal R\">\\(C\\notin\\mathcal R\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\">\\(|\\operatorname{InjElem}(A_\\bullet,r_*,e)|&lt;\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02f37a11ca2f55ac\" href=\"?note=02f37a11ca2f55ac\" title=\"20-df-maximal-agreement\">20-df-maximal-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"18e11f4651f28406\" href=\"?note=18e11f4651f28406\" title=\"20-df-injury-elements\">20-df-injury-elements</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fec296dc8eb84564\" href=\"?note=fec296dc8eb84564\" title=\"20-lem-use-preservation\">20-lem-use-preservation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}delta2\\text{-}preservation}\\vdash\n\\Phi_e^A\\ne\\chi_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>设最后一次损伤在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 以前，并反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\">\\(\\Phi_e^A=\\chi_C\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\">\\(\\ell(e,s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>，特别 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,s)\\to\\infty\">\\(m(e,s)\\to\\infty\\)</span>。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，有效搜索 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;v\">\\(s&gt;v\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(m(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\">\\(\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(p)\\)</span> 停止，返回其输出。该搜索必停止。</p>\n<p>从此以后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(e,t)\\ge m(e,s)&gt;p\">\\(m(e,t)\\ge m(e,s)&gt;p\\)</span>，所以该输入的固定有限停止 use 在每阶段都仍被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_*(e,t)\">\\(r_*(e,t)\\)</span> 覆盖。无损伤和 use 保持引理归纳保证它永不改变，因而输出等于真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(p)=\\chi_C(p)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(p)=\\chi_C(p)\\)</span>。此普通搜索带有限常数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 计算了非可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，矛盾。它不需目标位单向变化，正是历史最大值的作用。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 7.6.2；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-injury-elements","status":"resolved","id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-injury-elements]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-use-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"fec296dc8eb84564","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-use-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-maximal-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnc